<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>五运六气 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%BF%90%E5%85%AD%E6%B0%94/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 08:55:11 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%BF%90%E5%85%AD%E6%B0%94/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>天地人三才时钟：中医时空医学的精密解码</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/tiandirensancaishizhong/</link><pubDate>Sat, 21 Mar 2026 19:30:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/tiandirensancaishizhong/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8C%BB%E8%AF%9D/">医话</category><description>这三枚罗盘，看似独立，实则同源。天管“何时”——五运六气揭示了天地气运的宏观节律；地管“何地”——地理水土破译了不同地域的疾病密码；人管“何症”——气血流注与六经传变描摹了人体自身的生理病理潮汐。三者叠加，便是中医时空医学的全貌。</description></item><item><title>至真要大论篇第七十四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-74/</link><pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-74/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>系统阐述了六气（风、热、湿、火、燥、寒）的周期性变化规律及其对人体病理生理的影响，提出了&amp;quot;天人相应&amp;quot;的整体观和&amp;quot;以平为期&amp;quot;的治疗原则，强调通过五味调理、方剂配伍和标本论治等方法实现阴阳动态平衡。</description></item><item><title>天元纪大论篇第六十六</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-66/</link><pubDate>Sun, 06 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-66/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝与鬼臾区探讨五运六气与阴阳五行的关系，阐述天地运行规律对万物生化的影响，揭示三阴三阳与五运的对应法则，强调顺应天道的重要性。</description></item></channel></rss>